WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.490
It wants my ID. And this guy says he can do it for me?

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:14.203
Identity checks are usually there to confirm you are the account owner and to meet the rules.

00:00:14.203 --> 00:00:16.281
Make sure it's the official flow first.

00:00:16.281 --> 00:00:19.370
Don't hand your ID or codes to an 'agent' in a chat group.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.701
Usually you enter your real details, upload a supported valid ID,

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:38.356
then follow the prompts for a photo or face check.

00:00:38.356 --> 00:00:41.648
Whether you need proof of address, and which IDs are accepted,

00:00:41.648 --> 00:00:43.560
depends on your region and platform.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:04.585
If it fails, read the reason first. Is the ID expired? Is there glare?

00:01:04.585 --> 00:01:09.540
Does the name match? Fix it as instructed. Never try again with a fake identity.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.480
Once I'm done, can I trade right away?

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:28.302
Not guaranteed. The result,

00:01:28.302 --> 00:01:33.204
the products you can use and whether you can deposit all depend on the official notice.

00:01:33.204 --> 00:01:35.740
And this academy never collects your real ID.

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:48.550
Who gets your ID? Only the verified official flow. Not us, and not a stranger.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:59.542
Ready to verify? Start only on the official site.

00:01:59.542 --> 00:02:05.051
Our OKX partner link takes you straight there, with code nexu888 for a fee rebate.

00:02:05.051 --> 00:02:06.730
We never ask for your ID.

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:10.818
Deposit, buy, transfer: three buttons that all look the same.

00:02:10.818 --> 00:02:12.280
Next: which one to press.

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:14.880
Understand first, then act.
